            "review_title": "Review at MH Bistro Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Armie H\n2 contributions\n1\nPoor Customer Service\nSep 2017 • Couples\nDrive be towards the place and was given a seat and menu. After a few minutes, the waiter asked us to park our bikes somewhere else, was quite rude and said that we should do it ourselves. They totally agreed when I said they have poor customer service and we left the restaurant to go elsewhere. Happy we did.\nWritten September 30, 2017\nAn Bui\nHi Armie, we would like to extend to you our most sincere apologies regarding recent issues with you at our restaurant. We have a high standard of quality for customer service focus on customer's satisfaction. We are greatly appreciate the opportunity to discuss this further with you, if you willing to talk further please call our restaurant manager Selina (Ms) at +84969483222. Thanks and have a great day.\nRead more\nWritten October 4, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
