            "review_text": "NgocTran99\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam39 contributions\n0\nLovely restaurant\nJul 2016 • Friends\nI visited last week and was greeted with warmth and friendship, MH has a wonderful interesting menu - and most are amazing food w pasta, pizza!!!! I had a lovely evening talk with madam Hong, owner!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 28, 2017\nAn Bui\nThanks Ms. Ngọc for your review, we tried our best to have more interesting dishes in our menu soon, hope you will have time to come back and enjoy. Regards\nRead more\nWritten June 30, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
