            "review_text": "Long N\n1 contribution\n0\nA new bistro around your corner!\nNov 2016 • Friends\nFound this restaurant under my friend's apartment and surprisingly the food, drinks and music were much better than I assumed. A cozy, children friendly place for families, friends and even couples. The cakes are made fresh daily. Food made by order so you can expect some time for chatting. Live music on Fridays and Saturdays, and if lucky you can catch some great vocals in town. \n\nHighly recommend to all.\nRead more\nWritten November 17, 2016\nAn Bui\nThanks Long N for your comment in our tripadvisor place, your review about our restaurant is our idea to open this site for our neighbor and surrounds. We wish to create an lively atmosphere on weekend to everybody relax with their family after working. It 's easy, just few steps and we will get a nice and friendly place to enjoy the live.\nRead more\nWritten November 20, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
